ults-root counterpart readable. Alternatives considered: unsupported per-target adaptive IRT, limited-extrapolation kernel neighbors and scalar isotonic calibration. Selected log-odds curve plus prefix-matched residual ridge keeps acquisition fixed and admits direct ablations; saturation is a hypothesis, not a diagnosed failure. No candidate execution, exploratory computation, benchmark, external research or evaluator inspection occurred.\n- unknown_ts | step=unknown_step | scope=unknown_scope\n  - summary: (missing summary)\n  - evidence: (missing evidence)\n- unknown_ts | step=unknown_step | scope=unknown_scope\n  - summary: (missing summary)\n  - evidence: (missing evidence)\n- unknown_ts | step=unknown_step | scope=unknown_scope\n  - summary: (missing summary)\n  - evidence: (missing evidence)\n- 2026-11-17T13:21:48.537456+00:00 | step=evaluate | scope=attempt\n  - summary: harness evaluated program_1 exactly once\n  - evidence: combined_score=0.9453539826294075, correct=True; scientific acceptance passed; search metrics (data): {\"anchor_mae\": 0.13300734976798292, \"combined_score\": 0.9453539826294075, \"constant_mae\": 0.40526908638842024, \"control_correct\": 1.0, \"correct\": true, \"irt_mae\": 0.07504423299125063, \"kendall\": 0.7734254586835944, \"mae\": 0.05464601737059244, \"permuted_mae\": 0.07599748646182174, \"prior_mae\": 0.14429218883447575, \"rmse\": 0.07231380243004325, \"spearman\": 0.8854483329598837, \"uniform_mae\": 0.11168295368474038}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
