6618+00:00 | step=final | scope=paper\n- summary: paper.tex and claims_grounding.json are consistent with grounded inputs; gate=kept; trigger=none; reason=The final package comparison retains heterogeneity and supplies no isolated new mechanism.\n- evidence: Final manuscript uses official anonymous ICLR 2026 style: 8 body pages, references pages 9-10, substantive Supplementary Information pages 11-14. Local geometric last-body occupancy is 0.951, not a substitute for parent venue validation. 25 consulted relevant references, 66 valid claim mappings, all five aggregate MAEs reconciled, baseline additional metrics reconstructed only from recorded predictions, final completed/qualified facts retained independently of development selection. Main text preserves HELM MATH/LegalBench/MedQA reversals, conditional uncertainty, absent ablations, and unverified exact source-tree identity. Scientific-evidence report has zero dangling links; canonical section/citation/claim/rendered-SI checks pass. Canonical figure schema and strategy density limits pass; direct JSON-pointer/line checks pass. Canonical CLI module and Debian TeX-symlink limitations are disclosed in paper_checks.json and REPRODUCE.md. Supplemental table imports were replaced by checked verbatim generated tables. Concept PNG and empty prompts stub remain orchestrator-owned pending its synchronous render; no concept pipeline was launched here. No new estimator/evaluator execution or prohibited-literature identity search occurred.\n- next_action: Orchestrator should render score_prediction_overview from the strategy and finished manuscript, recompile, then run authoritative venue and evidence gates. Preserve qualification status, local reversals, component-attribution limits, and source-identity caveats in any repair.\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
