onsulted source scope: Ridge Regression: Biased Estimation for Nonorthogonal Problems\", \"citation_keys\": [\"Hoerl1970\"]}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature/software context, limited to the consulted source scope: Optimum Allocation in Linear Regression Theory\", \"citation_keys\": [\"Elfving1952\"]}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature/software context, limited to the consulted source scope: Bootstrap Methods: Another Look at the Jackknife\", \"citation_keys\": [\"Efron1979\"]}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature/software context, limited to the consulted source scope: Better Bootstrap Confidence Intervals\", \"citation_keys\": [\"Efron1987\"]}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature/software context, limited to the consulted source scope: Matplotlib: A 2D Graphics Environment\", \"citation_keys\": [\"Hunter2007\"]}\n{\"claim\": \"Literature/software context, limited to the consulted source scope: On Over-fitting in Model Selection and Subsequent Selection Bias in Performance Evaluation\", \"citation_keys\": [\"Cawley2010\"]}\nFinal evaluation: {\"status\": \"completed\", \"outcome\": \"qualified\", \"metrics\": {\"anchor_mae\": 0.15674229873896958, \"constant_mae\": 0.21577661527598374, \"control_correct\": 1.0, \"correct\": 1.0, \"irt_mae\": 0.05911223215296765, \"kendall\": 0.6715966634525837, \"mae\": 0.038991605535293065, \"permuted_mae\": 0.06257521756337783, \"prior_mae\": 0.08335016635136305, \"rmse\": 0.04837892636321264, \"spearman\": 0.8158480130897703, \"uniform_mae\": 0.10520541810011626}}\nAblations: []\nStrategy literature-related fields: []\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
